.SS "void csmp::TransientPressure_Example::Run ()\fR [virtual]\fP"

.PP

.PP
(4) 2D transient calculation constant rate draw down from a pumping well near a highly permeable fault\&. \fBModel\fP uses a 'Triangle' generated input mesh (file set well\&.1)

.PP
Use example_viewer\&.tcl to visualize vtk output

.PP
Vary the draw down rate and observe at which rate the fluid pressure becomes negative and the computation breaks down\&. Observe further how the presence of a highly- permeable fault zone changes the pressure diffusion 
.PP
